# Third-party notices

## PicoGraphics bitmap fonts

`tools/data/fonts.json` contains glyph masks and character widths derived from
the bitmap font data in:

    https://github.com/pimoroni/pimoroni-pico
    libraries/bitmap_fonts/font6_data.hpp
    libraries/bitmap_fonts/font8_data.hpp
    libraries/bitmap_fonts/font14_outline_data.hpp

The exact upstream commit is pinned in `tools/data/fonts.SOURCE.txt` and the
derivation is performed by `tools/build_fonts.py`.

